        <notes><![CDATA[
   file name: jna-5.14.0.aar
   False positive: the JNA (net.java.dev.jna) CPE collides with cpe:2.3:a:sun:java. These are
   late-1990s / 2009-era Sun Java vulnerabilities that are unrelated to the JNA library. JNA is a
   required runtime dependency for the adblock Rust/uniffi native wrapper.
   ]]></notes>
        <packageUrl regex="true">^pkg:maven/net\.java\.dev\.jna/jna@.*$</packageUrl>
